 "takeaways": [
  "**Carnot cycle:** isothermal expansion, adiabatic expansion, isothermal compression, adiabatic compression.",
  "\\( \\eta = 1 - T_c/T_h \\): set only by the reservoir temperatures (in kelvin).",
  "No engine working between the same two temperatures can be **more efficient** than a Carnot engine."
 ],
 "notes": [
